{"steam_appid":3300050,"steam_name":"System Breakdown","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3300050/1551492156/c4fdcef1df1453fdd1f1e5bda0d5ef430e8c0d28/1785760330/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1785760891","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257390949/21a5f13e726b88b11b7cd01e8a0ed8ca3be11aa2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1785760891","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/e949d48c06a5b35ec9cd864656ddbb500a9b6cf5/ss_e949d48c06a5b35ec9cd864656ddbb500a9b6cf5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786550567","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/ff12ee678344d85f35119fc569ef52e71f9aedc1/ss_ff12ee678344d85f35119fc569ef52e71f9aedc1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786550567","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/dbc9adf629e1d8e4fd7d0adc25b2a3a14a4d0ff3/ss_dbc9adf629e1d8e4fd7d0adc25b2a3a14a4d0ff3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786550567","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/4ff18c2c700031ecf5b500bb89a534cae812a0e4/ss_4ff18c2c700031ecf5b500bb89a534cae812a0e4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786550567","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/cb2bcb7fb3f54e404aad606341b2a966ff3f9e14/ss_cb2bcb7fb3f54e404aad606341b2a966ff3f9e14.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786550567"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/dc79413fc4b2dea016aa1fa8e6c151d6.poster.avif?t=1786550567\" width=1170 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/dc79413fc4b2dea016aa1fa8e6c151d6.webm?t=1786550567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/dc79413fc4b2dea016aa1fa8e6c151d6.mp4?t=1786550567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/119bd1dba0a5f9ad3b1e5db41521b56a.poster.avif?t=1786550567\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/119bd1dba0a5f9ad3b1e5db41521b56a.webm?t=1786550567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/119bd1dba0a5f9ad3b1e5db41521b56a.mp4?t=1786550567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >System Breakdown is not just a twin-stick shooter. You need to be aggressive in order to survive. Cycle between guns to gain ammunition. Perform the finisher move to heal yourself. Use special power-ups to destroy Clankers' armor and charge your Fury. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like games, such as <strong>Ruiner</strong> or <strong>Kill Knight</strong>, you will feel at home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/bba488046ab6096b57d092aa703d55b5.poster.avif?t=1786550567\" width=1170 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/bba488046ab6096b57d092aa703d55b5.webm?t=1786550567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/bba488046ab6096b57d092aa703d55b5.mp4?t=1786550567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/a8dcfecfc07d7888022f541268de077b.poster.avif?t=1786550567\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/a8dcfecfc07d7888022f541268de077b.webm?t=1786550567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/a8dcfecfc07d7888022f541268de077b.mp4?t=1786550567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big Brother monitors everything. The better you perform in trials, the more resources you earn for advanced weaponry and power-ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own style of destruction. Do you want to focus on pushing enemies onto a rocket explosion, or a Kimbo assault rifle Rambo Style? <strong>The choice is yours.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/3593c7490f6e01c45c5145ebf42bb21e.poster.avif?t=1786550567\" width=1170 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/3593c7490f6e01c45c5145ebf42bb21e.webm?t=1786550567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/3593c7490f6e01c45c5145ebf42bb21e.mp4?t=1786550567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/e82046bc3830ca744a591525146506fd.poster.avif?t=1786550567\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/e82046bc3830ca744a591525146506fd.webm?t=1786550567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/e82046bc3830ca744a591525146506fd.mp4?t=1786550567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Soviets won the Cold War, later created Big Brother to oversee this communist utopia. Everyone is equal, everyone is the same, everyone owns nothing, nobody can say anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last remnant of human hope. Locked in the Big Brother laboratory, you need to find a way to destroy his reign once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*Project System Breakdown by Anarchy Creations is co-financed by European Funds for Smart Economy 2021-2027 under the KPT ScaleUP Booster program.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/18989badb83651e84820295ca815a267.avif?t=1786550567\" width=1040 height=482 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/165e335f8f64cccded8e13283ba08b4b.avif?t=1786550567\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras_big/165e335f8f64cccded8e13283ba08b4b.webp?t=1786550567 width=1560 height=281 /></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3-6100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 970<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2400 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i7 8700k<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1660 Super,<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2400 MB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Casual","Indie"],"developers":["Anarchy Creations"],"publishers":["Anarchy Creations"],"release_date":"Aug 12, 2026"}